On GNOME Weather
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

GNOME Weather is useful to read for how an application drives GWeather, and it
appears in no part of this product. It is licensed GPL-2.0-or-later, which is
incompatible with the Apache License this work is distributed under, so no code
or comment may be copied from it. Reading it to learn which calls a flow needs is
fine; carrying its expression across is not.
